# EMR Vendor Evaluation Framework (Interoperability-Focused)

Vendor selection should prioritize interoperability
and long-term sustainability.

## Evaluation Dimensions
- ABDM readiness
- API availability & documentation
- Data standards support
- Security & privacy controls
- Scalability & performance

## Red Flags
- Proprietary data lock-in
- Limited API access
- Custom integrations without standards
- Weak consent management

## Best Practice
Prefer vendors aligned with open standards and national frameworks.
